<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Network> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named grouping of Lines under which a Transport network is known."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfLines>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfLines> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Group of Lines can be used to define several kinds of PT networks and sub-networks: what is usually called a ‘public transport network’ is in fact only a specific GroupOfLines and a Line may belong to several of them."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfEntities>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfEntities> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of Entities grouped together according to a purpose of grouping, e.g. grouping of stops known to the public by a common name."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Line> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A grouping of Routes that is generally known to the public by a similar name or number."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Route> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ordered list of located Points defining one single path through the road (or rail) Network. A Route may pass through the same Point more than once."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#LinkSequence>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#LinkSequence> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Link Sequence describes a path through a Network, such as a bus route. It can consist of an ordered set of Points in Sequence (referencing Points of a particular type) or Links in Sequence (referencing Links of a particular type)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#JourneyPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordered list of Scheduled Stop Points and Timing Points on a single Route, describing the pattern of working for public transport vehicles. A Journey Pattern may pass through the same Point more than once."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#LinkSequence>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Abstract class."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointInJourneyPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Each Point in Journey Pattern specifies the visit of a Service to a specific Point in a particular order within the pattern."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointInLinkSequence>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointInLinkSequence> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Point in a Link Sequence indicating its order in that particular Link Sequence."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimeTabledPassingTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The PassingTimes that are the result of the scheduling process and to be published in a timetable are called TimeTabledPassingTimes. \n\nThe TimeTabledPassingTimes are normally generated a long time before the day of operation and are valid over a long period of time (e.g. summer, winter timetable)"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PassingTime>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PassingTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Passing Time associates a time with a Point in Journey Pattern."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ServiceJourney> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vehicle Journey on which passengers will be allowed to board or alight from vehicles at stops."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#VehicleJourney>, <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Journey>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#VehicleJourney> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A VehicleJourney is the defined movement of a vehicle using a specified Journey Pattern on a particular Route. By virtue of being defined for a Day Type, a Vehicle Journey is a class of journeys that would take place at the same time on each day of a specified Day Type."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Journey>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Journey> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Travel from one place to another."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#LinkSequence>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ScheduledStopPoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Point where passengers can board or alight from vehicles."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimingPoint>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimingPoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Point against which the timing information necessary to build schedules may be recorded."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Point>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Point> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A 0-dimensional node of the Network used for the spatial description of the Network. Points may be located by a Location in a given Locating System."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ServiceJourneyLink> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The connection between two successive Scheduled Stop Points in a Service Journey. Since a Journey is always valid for a specific time (on a specific Day Type), each Service Journey Link has a specific departure and arrival time. Service Journey Links allow Route Planners to more easily calculate the shortest Routes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointOnRoute> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Point on Route indicates the sequence of a Route Point within a Route. This intermediate object is required to allow a Route to go several times through the same RoutePoint."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointInLinkSequence>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#RoutePoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Point used to define the shape of a Route through the Network. The same Point may be used in different Routes using a Point on Route."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Point>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#RouteLink> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An oriented link between two Route Points allowing the definition of a unique path through the Network. The same Route Link may be used in different Routes."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Link>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Link> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Oriented spatial object of dimension 1 with view to the overall description of a Network, describing a connection between two Points."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ServiceLink> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Link between an ordered pair of Scheduled Stop Points."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Link>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPlace> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Stop Place represents a station, stop, port, airport or any physical point of access to the transport network."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Site>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Site> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type of Place, such as a Stop Place, Point of Interest or Address, to which passengers may wish to travel."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteElement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteElement> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Common properties of a spatially situated Place."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AddressablePlace>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PassengerStopAssignment> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The allocation of a Scheduled Stop Point  to a Stop Place."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AddressablePlace> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Place that has an Address."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Place>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Quay> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A  place such as a platform, bus stop, stance or quay side where passengers have access to public transport vehicles, taxi, cars or other means of transportation."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPlaceSpace>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPlaceSpace> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Space that is part of a Stop Place, like a Quay or a Stop Place Entrance."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteComponent>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteComponent> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A component of a Site describing a part of its structure. Shares common properties for equipment, management, accessibility and other features."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteElement>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPlaceEntrance> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical entrance or exit to/from a Stop Place for a passenger."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPlaceSpace>, <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Entrance>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Entrance> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Physical entrance or exit to/from a Site."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#SiteComponent>;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "May be a door,barrier,gate or other recognisable point of access."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TopographicPlace> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A geographical settlement which provides topographical context when searching for or presenting travel information, for example as the origin or destination of a trip."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Place>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Place> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Topographically significant location that a transport model may wish to describe."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Zone>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Zone> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Two-dimensional place within the service area of a public transport operator."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfPoints>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#CrewBase> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A place where operating employees (e.g. drivers) report on and register their work."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfPoints> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A grouping of Points."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfEntities>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ServiceJourneyPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Journey Pattern for a (passenger carrying) Service Journey."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#LinkSequence>, <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#JourneyPattern>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#StopPointInJourneyPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Each Point inJourney Pattern specifies the visit of a Service to a specific Scheduled Stop Point in a particular order within the pattern."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimingPointInJourneyPattern>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimingPointInJourneyPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A point in a Journey Pattern which is a Timing Point"@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PointInJourneyPattern>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfStopPlaces> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A grouping of Stop Places which will be commonly referenced for a specific purpose (stops inside an airport, main stops of a city, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GroupOfEntities>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TrainComponent> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specification of the order of TrainElements in a Train."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TrainElement> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Elementary component of a Train."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Train> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vehicle composed of TrainElements in a certain order, i.e. of wagons assembled together and propelled by a locomotive or one of the wagons."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#VehicleType>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#VehicleType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Vehicles may be classified using a Vehicle Type according to how they meet vehicle scheduling requirements as to capacity and on-board facilities (e.g. standard bus, double decker, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DeadRun> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A non-service Vehicle Journey."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#VehicleJourney>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DeadRunPattern> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Journey Pattern to be used for Dead Runs."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#JourneyPattern>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Block> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The work of a vehicle from the time it leaves a Parking Point after parking until its next return to park at a Parking Point."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ParkingPoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Relief Point where vehicles may stay unattended for a long time."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ReliefPoint>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ReliefPoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Timing Point where a relief is possible, i.e. a driver may take on or hand over a vehicle. The vehicle may sometimes be left unattended."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#TimingPoint>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#GaragePoint> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Parking Point in a Garage."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ParkingPoint>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DayType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type of day characterised by one or more properties which affect public transport operation."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example: weekday in school holidays."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Garage> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Facility used for parking and maintaining vehicles."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AddressablePlace>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#ServiceCalendar> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collection of Day Types Assignments."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DayTypeAssignment> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assignment of operational characteristics, expressed by Day Types, to particular Operating Days within a Service Calendar."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PropertyOfDay> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A property which a day may possess, such as school holiday, weekday, summer, winter etc."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#PassengerCapacity> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The maximum number of passengers that can travel with a Vehicle."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#FacilitySet> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Facilities available at a Site or Service."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Timeband> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A period in a day, significant for some aspect of public transport, e.g. similar traffic conditions or fare category."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AccessibilityLimitation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes the usability of an entity for passengers with certain needs."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Accommodation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Characteristics of the accommodation available on a service."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Eg First Class Couchette with Shower."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Operator> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A company providing public transport services."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#Organization>, <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AuthorityOrOperator>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AuthorityOrOperator> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Authority or an Operator."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Abstract class, i.e. one of its subclasses Authority or Operator should be instantiated."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#JourneyPartCouple> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of two ore more JourneyParts of different VehicleJourneys, served simultaneously by the same Train by coupling individual vehicles."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#JourneyPartPosition> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relative position in the train of a JourneyPart from a given stop onwards."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Authority> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organisation under which the responsibility of organising the transport service in a certain area is placed."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#Organization>, <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AuthorityOrOperator>;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#AccessibilityAssessment> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The accessibility characteristics of an entity used by passengers such as a Stop Place."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Presentation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines a uniform set of values to control appearances of an element (on a map, a schematic map, a paper or screen description, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#Direction> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "States the relative direction of use of a Line, e.g. \"North Bound\", \"South Bound\", etc."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DestinationDisplay> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An advertised destination of a specific Line or Journey Pattern, usually displayed on a head sign or at other on-board locations."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
