    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An optional part of a Destination Display that distinguishes different possible paths between an origin and a destination."@en;
