<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#DestinationDisplayVariant> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Variant of a given Destination Display, as needed for different media channels (electronic, printed, audio, mobile app, etc.)."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
