    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes the Facilities available onboard a service. It additionally allows the type of Accommodation (seating, couchettes, etc.) to be described."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/timetables-and-planning#FacilitySet>;
