    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An identified storey (ground, first, basement, mezzanine, etc) within an interchange building or Site on which Site Components reside."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
